[
  {
    "text": "What would make an AI fishing",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.33,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "rule worth testing?",
    "start": 2.36,
    "end": 3.9,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "A September eleventh paper explores",
    "start": 5.4,
    "end": 7.489999999999999,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "that question with eastern Bering",
    "start": 7.52,
    "end": 9.67,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "Sea pollock.",
    "start": 9.7,
    "end": 10.62,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "Researchers affiliated with the",
    "start": 11.6,
    "end": 13.67,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "Alaska Fisheries Science Center",
    "start": 13.7,
    "end": 15.450000000000001,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "built simulations informed by historical",
    "start": 15.48,
    "end": 18.47,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "observations.",
    "start": 18.5,
    "end": 19.28,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "Their agent practices harvest choices",
    "start": 20.64,
    "end": 23.009999999999998,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "through repeated simulated seasons.",
    "start": 23.04,
    "end": 25.28,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "Feedback rewards outcomes and changes",
    "start": 26.24,
    "end": 29.349999999999998,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "the learned rule.",
    "start": 29.38,
    "end": 30.28,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "They compare it with a predefined",
    "start": 31.4,
    "end": 33.79,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "harvest rule.",
    "start": 33.82,
    "end": 34.72,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "Will an advantage hold when the",
    "start": 35.5,
    "end": 37.69,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "biology changes?",
    "start": 37.72,
    "end": 38.64,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "Start with a model where young",
    "start": 39.64,
    "end": 41.67,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "fish enter at a constant rate.",
    "start": 41.7,
    "end": 43.8,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "The learned policy leaves more",
    "start": 45.16,
    "end": 47.17,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "spawning biomass, the weight of",
    "start": 47.2,
    "end": 49.41,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "breeding fish, than its comparison,",
    "start": 49.44,
    "end": 51.41,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "alongside large annual catch swings.",
    "start": 51.44,
    "end": 54.64,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "The next experiment links young",
    "start": 55.76,
    "end": 58.23,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "fish entering the stock to the",
    "start": 58.26,
    "end": 60.03,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "breeding population.",
    "start": 60.06,
    "end": 61.04,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "This is a separate simulated case",
    "start": 62.04,
    "end": 64.15,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "with its own comparison.",
    "start": 64.18,
    "end": 65.56,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "Here the learned rule catches more",
    "start": 66.82,
    "end": 69.15,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "and leaves less breeding biomass",
    "start": 69.18,
    "end": 71.13,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "than that comparison.",
    "start": 71.16,
    "end": 72.3,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "These simulated gains may offer",
    "start": 73.88,
    "end": 76.01,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "no management advantage over a",
    "start": 76.04,
    "end": 78.09,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "predefined rule.",
    "start": 78.12,
    "end": 79.08,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "In real fisheries, NOAA Fisheries",
    "start": 80.1,
    "end": 83.05,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "and the North Pacific Fishery Management",
    "start": 83.08,
    "end": 84.78999999999999,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "Council manage Alaska pollock.",
    "start": 84.82,
    "end": 87.0,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "Fishing businesses need sound management",
    "start": 87.92,
    "end": 90.49,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "to plan their seasons.",
    "start": 90.52,
    "end": 91.84,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "So test both rules against the",
    "start": 92.94,
    "end": 95.35,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "same catch-pattern and breeding-stock",
    "start": 95.38,
    "end": 97.37,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "goals.",
    "start": 97.4,
    "end": 98.10000000000001,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "These are illustrative simulations",
    "start": 98.86,
    "end": 100.77,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "with public code.",
    "start": 100.8,
    "end": 102.02,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "They establish alternatives to",
    "start": 102.74,
    "end": 104.47,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "investigate, not a winning real-world",
    "start": 104.5,
    "end": 106.81,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "policy.",
    "start": 106.84,
    "end": 107.33,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "Which balance should a rule demonstrate",
    "start": 107.36,
    "end": 110.23,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "between catches and breeding fish?",
    "start": 110.26,
    "end": 112.64,
    "seg": 17
  }
]